# Text building, splitting, replacing and case.
line is ""
count from 1 to 3000 as i
    line is line plus "x"
.
say length of line
csv is "alpha,beta,gamma,delta,epsilon"
total is 0
count from 1 to 3000 as i
    split csv by "," into parts
    total is total plus length of parts
.
say total
sentence is "the quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog"
count from 1 to 2000 as i
    replace "fox" with "otter" in sentence into changed
.
say changed
say uppercase of changed
